+For a separate, read-only audit of **previously recorded** agent work, use
+`AgentEvaluator(agent=None, evaluators=[...]).evaluate_recorded(golden_set, actual_by_eval_id)`.
+The second argument maps each expected evaluation ID to its saved `DialogTurn`
+list. Unlike `evaluate()`, this does not rerun the operational agent. It
+rejects missing/extra cases, duplicate identifiers, empty metric sets and
+truncated turn lists rather than reporting a misleading pass. Select
+`ResponseMatchEvaluator` with `SimilarityMetric.EXACT` and/or
+`ToolTrajectoryEvaluator` for a fully deterministic offline audit; choosing a
+model-backed judge explicitly opts back into model use. Recorded data is not
+cryptographically authenticated and this API does not itself establish
+independent organizational authority.
+
